  "releaseNotes": "fix:Fixed an issue where blacked-out dates could not be selected during calendar initialization when AllowSelectBlackedOutDay was enabled.\nfeat:Refactor time handling by adding ISystemClock and static Clock.Current\nThis enables custom time sources, improves testability, and allows users to override “today” in WPF calendar controls.\nIntroduced ISystemClock interface\nAdded SystemClock default implementation\nAdded static Clock.Current for global time control\nUpdated calendar components to use Clock instead of DateTime.Now",
